# tigerbeetle ships a prebuilt static archive (libtb_client_aarch64-macos.a)
# whose members are not 8-byte aligned, which the current Apple linker rejects.
# It links only under the deprecated -ld_classic, so exclude it on Darwin rather
# than pin the whole build to a linker that is being removed. Untested on Linux.
tigerbeetle	!darwin
timeplus
twitter
wasm
zeromq
